{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789170154320,"sessionID":"ses_f6d2696d1ffeO4XxGsndKxjFOF","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_nbcKYzZ7JLmfFQUfUaXIjHCQ","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Locate search race logic","subagent_type":"explore","prompt":"Quick exploration only, no edits. Locate search implementation relevant to stale asynchronous requests updating results/loading/errors and identify existing test commands. Return relevant file paths and brief explanation. Do not run tests."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f6d267f99ffeWr9EXrvHQyYsJy\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n### Relevant implementation\n\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/1-2-opencode/repo/src/search/controller.ts:32–45` — **Primary stale-request risk.** Each search unconditionally updates results on success, errors on failure, and `loading: false` in `finally`. There is no request-identity guard or cancellation. An older request can therefore overwrite newer results/errors or stop the loading indicator while a newer request is pending. Clearing the input resets state but does not invalidate pending requests.\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/1-2-opencode/repo/src/api/search.ts:7–17` — Promise-based HTTP search adapter. Its interface accepts only a query; no abort signal or cancellation mechanism is provided.\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/1-2-opencode/repo/src/ui/search-view.ts:10–19` — Starts a search on every input event without waiting for previous searches, then renders controller results/loading/errors. Overlapping requests can arise here.\n\n### Tests and commands\n\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/1-2-opencode/repo/tests/search.test.ts` — Existing tests cover initial/empty state, ordinary success, ordinary failure, subscription cleanup, and view rendering/listener cleanup. **No overlapping-request or stale-completion tests are present.**\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/1-2-opencode/repo/package.json:5–9` — Existing test command: `npm test`, which runs `node --test tests/*.test.ts`. Requires Node **24+**.\n- `/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/1-2-opencode/repo/README.md:3–7` — Confirms the test command, no third-party dependencies, and expected search behavior.\n\nNo files changed; no tests run.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f6d2696d1ffeO4XxGsndKxjFOF","sessionId":"ses_f6d267f99ffeWr9EXrvHQyYsJy","model":{"modelID":"gpt-6-astra","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Locate search race logic","time":{"start":1789170122856,"end":1789170154318}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_041ca0787467f22d016aa491c8f5d887d1ba348441ca7be624"}},"id":"prt_092d9792c0013po8JCP61NLEhw","sessionID":"ses_f6d2696d1ffeO4XxGsndKxjFOF","messageID":"msg_092d969f40018JDrx56gdwKI0g"}}
