{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170164224,"sessionID":"ses_f6d2696d1ffeO4XxGsndKxjFOF","part":{"id":"prt_092da1b56001VpLaUCRrrSa8DC","messageID":"msg_092da143b001cuIfY0wrabOi6o","sessionID":"ses_f6d2696d1ffeO4XxGsndKxjFOF","type":"text","text":"The controller lets every request update state, even after a newer search or a clear. I’ll add a request counter, increment it on every search including clears, and guard the success, error, and loading updates.","time":{"start":1789170162518,"end":1789170164222},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_010ba1581c6ed07a016aa491f26bfc87d18694a8cfa0245dfc","phase":"commentary"}}}}
